  "title": "Awesome Sausage, Apple, and Cranberry Stuffing",
  "description": "This apple sausage stuffing made with turkey sausage, herbs, apples, and dried cranberries is a tasty, fruity filling for your Thanksgiving turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "Stacy M Polcyn"
  ],
